{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #f4f2e9; box-sizing: border-box; color: #263c69; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #263c69; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #264ba3; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 34px 20px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #ffffff; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e一整块纯净高饱和的克莱因钴蓝铺满卷首，无需繁琐花纹，单凭色彩力量就能瞬间抓住目光。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 34px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #264ba3; color: #264ba3; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e当代艺术馆的强色块开场\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #263c69; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e满幅钴蓝导语块与下方利落白纸形成强烈对比，打破千篇一律的“小标签+白底”审美疲劳。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #e2e5ed; border: 0; color: #263c69; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 26px 20px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e真正有气场的色彩，一块就够了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"background-color: #f4f2e9; border: 1px solid #5b6c8e; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 12px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"光影分明的现代美术馆白色建筑\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 34px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #264ba3; color: #264ba3; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e克莱因蓝版式的适用场景\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e展览导览、品牌视觉升级与设计趋势\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e强观点深度专栏与年度发布\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e高对比色彩在列表里一眼跳出\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #5b6c8e; color: #263c69; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e走出展厅，那抹钴蓝仍会停留在记忆深处。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
